        "created_at": "2012-09-22T14:43:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I just got my kickstarter stuff (great job by the way) and only got the upgrade box instead of the entire enhanced core set.&nbsp;&nbsp; Now I am eager to replace those revamped singles in the various decks.&nbsp;&nbsp; Is there a way to put together a replacement card set that is just the ones altered when the enhanced ed came out?&nbsp; I could manually go through and pick them but if there was a already pre-constructed set put together that would be awesome! :-)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
